WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:05.963
First: a Resource Graph
query returns no Arc servers.

3
00:00:05.963 --> 00:00:07.576
What's the first thing to check?

4
00:00:07.576 --> 00:00:12.303
The answer is b: whether the identity
has Reader on the scope, because Resource

5
00:00:12.303 --> 00:00:16.587
Graph returns nothing for resources
the caller can't read, and no error.

6
00:00:16.587 --> 00:00:22.874
Second: a Windows Server 2012 R2 machine
has an Arc E S U license assigned.

7
00:00:22.874 --> 00:00:26.950
What does lifecycle report
on November third, 2026?

8
00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:29.187
The answer is b, unsupported.

9
00:00:29.187 --> 00:00:33.000
The E S U years ended on
October thirteenth, 2026,

10
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.301
so no updates come through
any channel, license or not.

11
00:00:37.301 --> 00:00:42.260
The module page has three more questions,
each linked to the unit that answers it.
